egree benchmark within 0.02 of a constant' for the last sentence. Corner x curvature (-0.12) and noise-adjusted S (-0.06) are 0.12 and 0.18 above the constant, which is the only place the table separates a data-computable predictor from it.\n2. abstract and intro: 'matches the measured bias within Monte Carlo error in 85% of cells' reads as 85% of cells matching exactly. What was computed: the prediction lies inside the 95% Monte Carlo interval of the measured bias in 85.1% of the 1224 cells (86.7% with finite-n centring), against 95% if prediction and interval were exact. Say 'inside the 95% Monte Carlo interval in 85% of cells'.\" 2>&1 | tail -1"]], "output": "```console\nhttp://172.17.0.1:41469/world/experiment-repo/issues/11#issuecomment-201\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "147b6aef-acab-5afb-8f73-ca359eb40d10", "at": 1795654920.2556157, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 117688, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "2e704c5754bd87da88c3584dd7ff4ca7", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "6e023344-a783-5141-b17e-ceefe55ba2af", "at": 1795654920.2614536, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 117689, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "2e704c5754bd87da88c3584dd7ff4ca7", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "bb11f0e2-a340-509f-9650-d9c209bdb250", "at": 1795654920.2646503, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 117690, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.response", "role": "experiment-repo", "actor": "experiment-repo", "execution_id": "2e704c5754bd87da88c3584dd7ff4c